{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/routing/automation","title":"CLI automation","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"cli-automation","children":[{"t":"text","text":"CLI automation"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Writing a typed route by hand means four pieces that must agree: the route, its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"componentDeps"},{"t":"text","text":", the "},{"t":"code","text":"withRetry"},{"t":"text","text":" wrapper and the DI check. The CLI writes all"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"four, and the output stays ordinary editable TypeScript."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use it for"}]},{"t":"text","text":" day-to-day route authoring and for migrating an existing app."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Then edit the result"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — nothing here is generated code you must not touch."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools"},{"t":"text","text":" provides codemods to migrate an existing application to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Craft primitives, services, type-safe routes, and selectorless Craft Components."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"install-the-migration-tool","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Install the migration tool"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"install","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/core","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"install","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--save-dev","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"shell","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The migration binaries are available starting with "},{"t":"code","text":"0.5.1-beta.0"},{"t":"text","text":" and are"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"currently published on the "},{"t":"code","text":"beta"},{"t":"text","text":" tag. The "},{"t":"code","text":"latest"},{"t":"text","text":" version and older beta"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"versions do not include "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-migrate"},{"t":"text","text":". If the package was installed before"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that release, update it and verify the resolved version:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"install","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--save-dev","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"ls","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"shell","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Commit or stash the current application changes before running a migration in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"write mode."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"run-the-complete-migration","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Run the complete migration"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Preview all migrations first:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-migrate","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tsconfig.app.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--root","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"src","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--dry-run","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"shell","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Then apply them:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-migrate","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tsconfig.app.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--root","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"src","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--write","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"shell","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft-migrate"},{"t":"text","text":" runs the migrations in the required order:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":true,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft-migrate-primitives"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft-migrate-services"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft-migrate-routes"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft-migrate-components"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft-migrate-architecture"}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The "},{"t":"code","text":"--write"},{"t":"text","text":" command also runs ESLint fixes on the touched files. Use"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"--no-eslint"},{"t":"text","text":" only when your project runs this step separately."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"run-a-targeted-migration","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Run a targeted migration"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use an individual codemod when the earlier stages have already been migrated:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-migrate-routes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tsconfig.app.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--root","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"src","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--dry-run","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-migrate-routes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tsconfig.app.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--root","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"src","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--write","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-migrate-components","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tsconfig.app.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--root","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"src","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--write","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-migrate-architecture","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tsconfig.app.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--root","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"src","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--write","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"shell","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The route migration converts supported route collections to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"craftRoutes(...)"},{"t":"text","text":", adds type-safe route metadata, and reports transformations"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that require a manual decision."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"For a nested route collection, provide its mount context when it cannot be"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"inferred safely:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-migrate-routes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"src/app/admin/admin.routes.ts","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tsconfig.app.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--parent-mount","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"admin","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--parent-names","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"CurrentUser,Permissions","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--write","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"shell","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"review-diagnostics","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Review diagnostics"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Write the complete report to a JSON file:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-migrate","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tsconfig.app.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--root","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"src","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--dry-run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"migration-report.json","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"shell","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Resolve every manual diagnostic before considering the migration complete."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"In particular, verify generated "},{"t":"code","text":"componentDeps"},{"t":"text","text":", inherited route providers,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"lazy child collections, and the file-level DI checks."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"add-a-ci-check","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Add a CI check"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"After applying and reviewing the migration, prevent supported legacy patterns"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and unresolved manual diagnostics from returning:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-migrate","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tsconfig.app.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--root","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"src","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--check","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--fail-on-manual","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"shell","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Finish with the application's normal lint, type-check, test, and build commands."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"See the "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/resources/migration","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"complete migration guide"}]},{"t":"text","text":" for the post-codemod checklist."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"make-the-di-contract-enforceable","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Make the DI contract enforceable"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The CLI writes the route, "},{"t":"code","text":"componentDeps"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"withRetry"},{"t":"text","text":" and the DI proof. Those"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"proofs are unused type aliases: omit one and the project still compiles. That"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is the one fragile step in an otherwise compile-time guarantee."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture#assertroutediproofs","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Architecture tests"}]},{"t":"text","text":" close it."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"assertRouteDiProofs"},{"t":"text","text":" walks the static graph and fails unless every routed"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"component — including lazy "},{"t":"code","text":"loadChildren"},{"t":"text","text":" collections — every pending or error"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"screen, and every "},{"t":"code","text":"craftAppConfig"},{"t":"text","text":" error surface is hooked to an armed mapper."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"TypeScript still judges whether a dependency is provided; the architecture"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"suite judges whether that judgement was invoked."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Add "},{"t":"code","text":"assertRouteDiProofs"},{"t":"text","text":" to the app's architecture suite and run it in CI."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"That is the application-facing check for the routing contract."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"compiler-fixture-suite-optional","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Compiler fixture suite (optional)"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft route verify"},{"t":"text","text":" is a separate, heavier check: it type-checks the project,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"then writes temporary valid and invalid fixtures covering route DI, "},{"t":"code","text":"toProvide"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"providers, lazy child checks, route params and inputs, Craft templates,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"templates, pending/error components, lazy loading, guard/resolve/component"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"exceptions, local recovery and exhaustive handlers. Invalid fixtures are"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"expected to fail, and their diagnostics are matched with the expected "},{"t":"code","text":"path"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"pending component"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"exception component"},{"t":"text","text":" context."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use it when you need to regression-test the type machinery itself — not as the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"app's proof that "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"your"}]},{"t":"text","text":" routes still carry "},{"t":"code","text":"CanRun"},{"t":"text","text":". Architecture tests cover"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"{","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"scripts\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"craft:verify-routes\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"craft route verify --project tsconfig.app.json\"","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"json","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft:verify-routes","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"shell","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fixtures are removed in a "},{"t":"code","text":"finally"},{"t":"text","text":" block. Use "},{"t":"code","text":"--json"},{"t":"text","text":" for a machine-readable"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"report, "},{"t":"code","text":"--root"},{"t":"text","text":" when the application source root is not detected"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"automatically, and "},{"t":"code","text":"--keep-fixtures"},{"t":"text","text":" only while diagnosing a failed"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"verification. "},{"t":"code","text":"--project"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"--tsconfig"},{"t":"text","text":" are aliases for selecting the app"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"tsconfig."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This validates compile-time and ESLint bookkeeping guarantees. Runtime"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"chunk-loading scenarios remain covered by the browser tests."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"see-also","children":[{"t":"text","text":"See Also"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/routing/setup","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Routing setup"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — what the CLI generates for you"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Architecture rules"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — "},{"t":"code","text":"assertRouteDiProofs"},{"t":"text","text":" is the app-facing routing check"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/routing/scaling","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Scaling routes"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — "},{"t":"code","text":"craft route split"}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"install-the-migration-tool","text":"Install the migration tool"},{"level":2,"id":"run-the-complete-migration","text":"Run the complete migration"},{"level":2,"id":"run-a-targeted-migration","text":"Run a targeted migration"},{"level":2,"id":"review-diagnostics","text":"Review diagnostics"},{"level":2,"id":"add-a-ci-check","text":"Add a CI check"},{"level":2,"id":"make-the-di-contract-enforceable","text":"Make the DI contract enforceable"},{"level":2,"id":"compiler-fixture-suite-optional","text":"Compiler fixture suite (optional)"},{"level":2,"id":"see-also","text":"See Also"}]}